s/d/da/Lachs_lebendig.png\" width=\"32\"/></div></div><div><div><img alt=\"Lachs tot.png\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/8/8a/Lachs_tot.png\" width=\"32\"/></div></div><div><div><img alt=\"Lachs gegrillt.png\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/8/8b/Lachs_gegrillt.png\" width=\"32\"/></div></div></td> <td><a data-w=\"Lachs\">Lachs</a></td> <td>stellt 350 MP wieder her </td></tr> <tr> <td><div><div><img alt=\"Lotusfisch lebendig.png\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/8/8f/Lotusfisch_lebendig.png\" width=\"32\"/></div></div><div><div><img alt=\"Lotusfisch tot.png\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/a/a1/Lotusfisch_tot.png\" width=\"32\"/></div></div><div><div><img alt=\"Lotusfisch gegrillt.png\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/3/3a/Lotusfisch_gegrillt.png\" width=\"32\"/></div></div></td> <td><a data-w=\"Lotusfisch\">Lotusfisch</a></td> <td>stellt 500 TP sofort wieder her </td></tr> <tr> <td><div><div><img alt=\"Mandarinfisch lebendig.png\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/b/bb/Mandarinfisch_lebendig.png\" width=\"32\"/></div></div><div><div><img alt=\"Mandarinfisch tot.png\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/7/7b/Mandarinfisch_tot.png\" width=\"32\"/></div></div><div><div><img alt=\"Mandarinfisch gegrillt.png\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/4/41/Mandarinfisch_gegrillt.png\" width=\"32\"/></div></div></td> <td><a data-w=\"Mandarinfisch\">Mandarinfisch</a></td> <td>stellt 180 MP wieder her </td></tr> <tr> <td><div><div><img alt=\"Regenbogenforelle lebendig.png\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/1/1a/Regenbogenforelle_lebendig.png\" width=\"32